category: Libs
requires: libbdplus0 pkg-config
sdesc: "Open implementation of BD+ protocol (development)"
ldesc: "This library is written for the purpose of playing Blu-ray movies. It is
intended for software that want to support Blu-ray playback (such as VLC and
MPlayer). We, the authors of this library, do not condone nor endorse piracy."
external-source: libbdplus

